Static Analysis Service

A standalone Python/FastAPI service that compiles submitted Solidity source, runs Slither, and returns structured security findings.

The current prototype accepts one Solidity source file per request and uses Solidity compiler **0.8.24**. It returns source hashes, tool/compiler versions, normalized source locations, and stable finding identifiers.

